  "id": "fear-of-flying",
  "term": "fear of flying",
  "definition": "Fear of flying, or aviophobia, is a phobic fear of air travel that can range from mild unease to intense panic and often leads to avoidance of flying. It is shaped by interacting psychological, bodily, environmental, and social factors, with common triggers including turbulence, enclosed spaces, and exposure to aviation accident coverage.",
